title Object model — domain layer

package "NFHotel.Domain" as DOM #FCFBF8 {

  class Booking <<entity>> {
    +BookingId
    +StartDate
    +EndDate
    +CheckOutDate
    +CheckInTime
    +CheckOutTime
    +Status
    +RoomId
    +GuestId
    .. derived ..
    +Period
    +EffectiveEndDate
    +EffectivePeriod
    +NumberOfNights
    +BookingNumber
    +CanConfirm
    +CanCheckOut
    +CanCancel
    +CanReschedule
    .. lifecycle ..
    {static} +Create(period, roomId, guestId, today)
    +CanCheckIn(today)
    +Confirm()
    +CheckIn(occurredAt, today)
    +CheckOut(occurredAt, checkOutDate, today)
    +Cancel()
    +Reschedule(newPeriod, newRoomId, today)
  }

  class Room <<entity>> {
    +RoomId
    +RoomNumber
    +Floor
    +Size
    +Capacity
    +Status
    +HousekeepingStatus
    .. derived ..
    +IsBookable
    +CanStartCleaning
    +CanCompleteCleaning
    +CanStartService
    +CanCompleteService
    .. transitions ..
    {static} +Create(roomNumber, floor, size, capacity)
    +UpdateDetails(...)
    +TakeOutOfService()
    +SendToMaintenance()
    +ReturnToService()
    +MarkDailyCleaningDue()
    +MarkDepartureCleaningDue()
    +StartCleaning()
    +CompleteCleaning()
    +ReportServiceNeeded()
    +StartService()
    +CompleteService(requiresCleaning)
  }

  class Guest <<entity>> {
    +GuestId
    +FirstName
    +LastName
    +Email
    +PhoneNumber
    +Country
    +PassportNumber
    +FullName
    {static} +Create(...)
    +UpdateDetails(...)
  }

  class DateRange <<value object>> {
    +Start
    +End
    +Nights
    +Overlaps(other)
    +Contains(date)
    +StartsOnOrAfter(today)
  }

  class BookingRules <<static>> {
    +Overlaps(a, b)
    +BlocksRoom(status)
    +Conflicts(existing, roomId, period)
  }
  class GuestRules <<static>>
  class RoomRules <<static>>

  enum BookingStatus
  enum RoomStatus
  enum HousekeepingStatus
  enum RoomSize
}


Guest "1" -- "0..*" Booking
Room  "1" -- "0..*" Booking
Booking ..> DateRange
Booking ..> BookingStatus
Room ..> RoomStatus
Room ..> HousekeepingStatus
Room ..> RoomSize
BookingRules ..> DateRange
BookingRules ..> BookingStatus
GuestRules ..> Guest
RoomRules ..> Room

note bottom of Booking
  **The Can* properties are not a UI convenience.**
  They are the guard the transition method itself
  uses, so the user interface can draw buttons by
  the same rule the domain enforces.

  **No DateTime.Now.** Every rule that needs today's
  date gets it as a parameter — which is why the
  state machine can be tested deterministically.
end note

@enduml
